{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_title", "source_sha256": "b85ec78c4030275aa226cc13ce2a7588e7dabdfe79e1bc767a553f0af560c182", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」三浦あずさ", "zh": "“自从与你相遇后”三浦梓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0e87fa0bb88f0354e78450441f23699e58e0700ce14d4d5efbc830c9b3be7b32", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\nあずさとプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前夕，\n梓与制作人回顾了两人从最初相遇至今的\n点点滴滴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30809b7a09f615b30d74c653c9ea4e49fb8b6b65d04ec8e481438095802eb363", "ja": "（公演の準備が進み、メディアの注目も\n高まってきた。これからあずささんの取材だ）", "zh": "（公演的准备工作正在推进，媒体的关注度也越来越高了。接下来要进行的是梓小姐的采访）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1001_p", "source_sha256": "afdc0747deb105b9e902f73b9c607bf7e013ddf935eafd8aa338b31983907b2c", "ja": "今日はDestiny公演に向けたあずささんの想いを\n色々と聞きたいそうです。", "zh": "听说今天想就为Destiny公演做准备的あずさ小姐的想法，向她了解一下各方面的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "210b42d930d746c25cd7a982484ced0d1227c202940324674882f63db6b2b88b", "ja": "はい、頑張りますね。\nDestiny……運命、という意味の……。", "zh": "好的，我会努力的。\nDestiny……意思是“命运”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "c96058254da95aabdec370fc55084637cd5fa5f44963cba69981755ec60bf52c", "ja": "ふふっ、やっぱり名前が名前だけに、\nちょっぴり緊張してしまいます。", "zh": "呵呵，果然因为这个名字，还是会有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "22691fbf3f43f4a54e82274de58a18fd7e6a1312088fc6447d63a22ba38e01b2", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、私がアイドルになった\n理由、覚えてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你还记得我成为偶像的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4d97bde399f8de7d24693d5796b1fff574c6420a3a50c563be2a551b4b224420", "ja": "もちろん。\n『運命の人に出会うため』でしたね。", "zh": "当然记得。\n是“为了遇见命中注定的人”，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "db4e0ee3a86e2eaaa95c1a3ce116d82020ddbc5d57a6b7cf1b72978272d65d50", "ja": "そうなんです。そんな私が、みんなと一緒に\n『運命』という名前の曲を歌うことになるなんて。", "zh": "就是这样。没想到这样的我，竟然会和大家一起演唱一首名为《命运》的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "a90ef3390a9c6e57ce2b6026c6f990cb49681cfbe31a37cb7f6127e5b15ea984", "ja": "不思議なめぐり合わせだなって思うんですけれど……\nもう不思議とは言えないかもしれません。", "zh": "我觉得真是奇妙的缘分……不过，或许已经不能说是奇妙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "e67c1abac3dde9c830e8a77d91729d206e5aaadfad995d7748688ce519862a7b", "ja": "だって私は、きっともう……\n出会っていますから。", "zh": "因为我一定已经……\n和它相遇了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1009_p", "source_sha256": "62a33a1c38309ae3ffe5ea82393b0b13181517838cd73cafbf84d2255b31e082", "ja": "……え？　それは……", "zh": "……诶？那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "a3499029afb1e9a4b8e6f8431dd19a1f900a2e812694f079aa225a0b31ead8dd", "ja": "はい。運命の人……\nというか、運命そのものに。", "zh": "是的。命中注定的那个人……\n不如说，是命运本身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8a7695721516030d459769c763d67219291ddfc5a07cce61e92cfa19bb75633", "ja": "今思えば、私はアイドルになるきっかけも、時期も、\nあまりアイドルらしくなかったと思うんですけれど……", "zh": "现在想来，我成为偶像的契机和时机，都不太像偶像会有的经历呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "b6d4891194f2dfdfdd5417d70ededa2f6ddbadd23c184ba7ca3fbee215066bc7", "ja": "こうして{$P$}さんやみんなと\n出会って、一緒にここまで歩いて来て。", "zh": "就这样与{$P$}先生以及大家相遇，一起走到了今天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c87a1227e50674ad0bfa1495253446cb0d0e6b250ff86ca98730c6eb992774c", "ja": "たどり着いた今の毎日が、\n本当に楽しくて、幸せですから♪", "zh": "一路走到今天的每一天，真的既开心又幸福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1014_p", "source_sha256": "56e4151558a279b94d3d7ba2db3ed42930a0b82783b8a3a035552cd02c920a85", "ja": "……よかった。そう思ってもらえているなら、\nプロデューサーとしても嬉しいです。", "zh": "……太好了。如果您能这么觉得，\n那我作为制作人也很欣慰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1015_p", "source_sha256": "716f850fbaffff1a6170e98a9f987b62fffd95ea24d46fc1ab8ee683f894c9af", "ja": "あずささんは、アイドルになる運命だった……。\nそうかもしれませんね。", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐，或许命中注定就是要成为偶像的……\n也许真是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "af799b5262f6812feab3d55a2c76d173e3973dad4a125f94179c2542d8a37d1b", "ja": "はい、それも765プロの……\n{$P$}さんのアイドルに。", "zh": "是的，而且还是765事务所的……成为了{$P$}先生的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf790bdd8f01199c16390883b474dbef99b94f01a646f50e0ab7a3559a151f6d", "ja": "はい。もちろんあずささんなら、\nどこの事務所でもうまくいったと思います。", "zh": "是的。当然，我觉得如果是梓小姐的话，无论在哪家事务所都能发展得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3e4c40c9e71bbb5c5ce829238298fa418205717ebe6957707fca066894e1c6a0", "ja": "でも、他のどこにも、誰にも任せたくない。\n……765プロに来てくれて、本当によかったです。", "zh": "可是，我不想把你交给其他任何事务所或任何人。\n……你愿意来到765事务所，真的太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "cf61453129db8b83b855e9495f7dd20636a59d96194a33dc51f494ff287ab597", "ja": "ま、まぁ……。\nあの、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "呃、嗯……  \n那个，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "03373a41bfb2b3d0092ee5f71ba568ec4bd5891769b05c03bd47a9a4c6ac4ad8", "ja": "でも、私は他の事務所に入っていたら、\nうまくいかなかったと思います。", "zh": "不过，如果我加入的是其他事务所，应该就不会这么顺利了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a11ffb1fdf4b02307df5e396ef4339a8d477cf1898cc2da0474b868be3dc4766", "ja": "いえ、そんなことは……", "zh": "不，不会那样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "434ff3dad5bf6523739e2fd22d138a0adaacbc20bc657fb71aa4d4d528355ee8", "ja": "そんなこと、あると思います♪\nうふふっ。", "zh": "我觉得就是这样呢♪\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "33b7ab7ca2774eab64f1aef2efbf29e2a3213d2a7ace3917665980403f6de70c", "ja": "すぐ迷子になってしまう私を、いつも見守ってくれて\n……私の手を引いて、一緒に歩いてくれる。", "zh": "一直守护着总是很快就会迷路的我，\n……牵着我的手，陪我一起走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "732682e8809803fb1d540733a178d650ab50f95e9f4aa31dcc0fddfa516704c7", "ja": "そんなあなたが隣にいてくれたから、\n私は今、ここにいます。", "zh": "正因为有你一直陪在我身边，\n我现在才能站在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "7d6af1c5763bc16c7f6deb0f743d3745e5215d3141356136bbb9598c31fad95a", "ja": "不束者ですけれど、これからも私の隣を、\n一緒に、歩いてくださいね。", "zh": "虽然我还有很多不足，但今后也请和我一起，走在我的身边，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f89bd1fccd4fedddb633df0d0d304c5986748a9e60c5dbb049608c1ec4d8a08f", "ja": "……こちらこそ。不束なプロデューサーですが、\nよければ、これからもずっと……支えさせてください。", "zh": "……我才是。虽然是个不成熟的制作人，\n如果你愿意，今后也请一直……让我支持你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "059c5ca157b74d3dc1381c3605e2d380c6963c4411791c40a7cba5647fa45b3e", "ja": "はい……♪", "zh": "好的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1029_p", "source_sha256": "131a5ee7f561366a929e466aa4b43e0e76eb840fc117791cfc9901b47422f31a", "ja": "というわけで、まずこの後の取材対応に向けて、\n支えていきます！", "zh": "那么，首先，为了应对接下来的采访，我会支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "de4b264e8eafdadab8ac22d78366c2e06639f1b092b68ecf12cbee2d0b16597a", "ja": "あっ……そ、そうでした～。話し込んでいるうちに、\n私ったら取材のことを、すっかり……！", "zh": "啊……对、对哦～聊着聊着，我都把采访的事忘得一干二净了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "d417cf3b6dd99466ccbc07b917b884295d827c75c04969b0852874127067fada", "ja": "ええと、何の取材だったかしら。\nええっと……最近のカフェ巡り？", "zh": "呃，是什么采访来着？\n呃……最近的咖啡馆巡游？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1032_p", "source_sha256": "43701c660ed2d37fed2279a05c49e4636e8031dc27fe7555c14880130de0ad4d", "ja": "いえ、Destiny公演に向けたあずささんの想いを、\n色々と。", "zh": "不是，主要是关于梓小姐面向Destiny公演的想法，\n想聊聊各方面的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "0e9777246f3bafb565f8eabb48a44840469d397fe8d05cce0b06faea5ed6ee84", "ja": "あ、そうそう、そうでした～。\nDestiny公演……Destiny……。", "zh": "啊，对对，是这么回事～  \nDestiny演出……Destiny……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_010azu_1034_p", "source_sha256": "da5a72bb43ccf41dfe36336a3c6207ef909c3dd48ec924964d589c8abc051c64", "ja": "（想いは巡り、出会いもまた巡る。何度でも\n繰り返そう。また新しい運命に、出会えるように……）", "zh": "（心意不断循环，邂逅也同样循环往复。让这一切一次又一次地重演吧。为了还能再次邂逅全新的命运……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
